      "text": "The powers of Section 124a of the New York City Charter concerning budget modifications are hereby withdrawn from all agencies and departments, except the Boards of Education and Higher Education, and the Community Colleges, the Offices of the Borough Presidents and Comptroller, the Board of Elections, District Attorneys, the City Council, the Courts, Office of Probation, and the Departments of Health, Hospitals and Correction.",
